(reimplementation of core utils RM command in vox)

A flag called recursive is "-r" or "--recursive", it is a boolean.
Open a file for writing at "/dev/stderr" called stderr.

To "remove a directory" with a text called "path".
  Remove the file called each filename from {list all files at path}.
  Remove the directory called "path".  

Remove the file called each filepath from arguments's all,
  but if the filepath is a directory and recursive, "remove a directory" with filepath,
  otherwise write "{arguments's name} cannot remove '{filepath}': Is a directory" to stderr.

Exit 0.
